<title>ITALY: Provisional Italian CPI data due Nov 20-22.</title>
<headline>Provisional Italian CPI data due Nov 20-22.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional inflation data for November from 10 major Italian cities will be released between November 20 to 22, national statistics office Istat said.</p>
<p>Istat gave the following calendar:</p>
<p>Nov 20: Venice.</p>
<p>Nov 21: Milan, Genova, Trieste, Bologna, Perugia, Palermo.</p>
<p>Nov 22: Turin, Florence, Naples.</p>
<p>All the data will be released at 1630 GMT.</p>
<p>Definitive November inflation data is due on December 5. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
